2. bol-van/zapret2
   https://github.com/bol-van/zapret2
   Linux engine (nfqws2), init.d scripts and lua/ runtime.
   Licensed under the MIT License by bol-van.

The adapter code (flowseal_convert.py, zapret-flowseal, zapret, install-here.sh)
is licensed under the MIT License, see LICENSE.

No binary payloads, host lists or Lua strategy scripts are shipped in this
repository: they are downloaded from upstream at install/update time.
